  "The Wind Lifts the Mist": {
   "rule": "Passive art (road-mist-primer L1, mist-lock-array-canon L1; authored wish d49): when the foe fires an art with the wind element tag, it lifts one mist of yours: your newest Field tagged mist ends, or your mist self-state (A Breath of Road Mist) if you have no mist Field. If a Lantern-Stone holds that field, the stone is spent instead and the field stands. The lift comes before that art's hit, so the mist it lifts cannot make it miss.",
   "approx": "engine.py fires events on resolution (was_hit/evaded) rather than pre-roll, and decoy_struck drops element; reacts to wind-element art hits/evades once per pulse in reverse priority (road_mist -> mist_field -> lantern_stone) without retroactively re-rolling that strike.",
